# text = The shipowner , smiling , followed him with his eyes until he saw him spring out on the quay and disappear in the midst of the throng , which from five o'clock in the morning until nine oâ€™clock at night , swarms in the famous street of La Canebière , -- a street of which the modern Phocéens are so proud that they say with all the gravity in the world , and with that accent which gives so much character to what is said , `` If Paris had La Canebière , Paris would be a second Marseilles . ''
